    },
    "name": "query_manifest",
  },
  {
    "description": "Run the hull fragment from the quarantine container through the analyzer. Needs the four-digit registry fragment the crew member reads off the stencil (send it as a string). There is no field on the page to type it; when they read you the digits, call this tool yourself.",
